A singer and songwriter whose sweetly sad tunes are warm and emotionally open, Myles Smith blends the gentle passion of his vocals with music that incorporates elements of contemporary folk, indie pop, and a dash of Americana. After finding an audience through social media, he developed an international following with the 2024 EP A Minute... and its break-out hit single, "Stargazing." The companion, A Minute, A Moment..., arrived in 2025.

